OL,3,GNEWSARoad closures for qualifying
OL,4,Apushed back
OL,5,
OL,6,FDaytime qualifying sessions for the
OL,7,FManx Grand Prix and Classic TT have
OL,8,Fbeen pushed by three hours to allow
OL,9,Froads to dry following heavy overnight
OL,10,Frain.
OL,12,FRoads around the 37.7 mile (61km)
OL,13,FMountain Course will now close at 12:30
OL,14,FBST as a result.
OL,16,FThe sessions, for both Manx Grand Prix
OL,17,F(MGP) and Classic TT classes are set to
OL,18,Frun throughout the afternoon, with road
OL,19,Fdue to open no later than 17:00.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
